  unitName: "Gemini of Abomination (EU, 7\u2605)"
  unitId: 750176
  unitNumber: 7138
  description: 'Here lies Skalmold, who brought about the present events by her actions
    and her selfishness... her epitaph reads: "The crazed crows have found the corrupted
    flames". Here lies Geirdriful, originator of the forbidden spell. While the stars
    of Gemini were blazing in an ebony night sky, oh how much she wished to remain
    resting in peace, the girl who had only wished to save her sister. The worlds
    are aflame with a black Corruption, and the victims, the survivors and the scribes,
    if they exist, will ask "Where did the Corruption devouring Yggdrasil and all
    worlds come from?". The silence of this guilt-ridden aberration will be their
    only answer.'
  summonDesc: Unknowingly, we were the origin of this disaster
  fusionDesc: Amidst the crows and the flames, souls strengthen us
